---
import BaseLayout from "@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="API" description="Machine-readable access to the OpenAgent.bot registry." path="/api">
  <div class="page-shell"><div class="page-grid">
    <section class="page-section"><span class="kicker">Public API / v1</span><h1 class="page-title">Built for agents,<br />readable by people.</h1><p class="lede">The first public endpoints expose entities and registry statistics. Change history and bulk dumps follow after the initial observation window.</p></section>
    <section class="page-section"><article class="prose">
      <h2>List entities</h2><p><code>GET /api/v1/entities.json</code></p><p>Query parameters: <code>q</code>, <code>domain</code>, <code>layer</code>, <code>kind</code>, <code>use_case</code>, <code>openness</code>, <code>sort</code>, <code>limit</code>, <code>offset</code>. Domain describes the ecosystem field, <code>layer</code> separates robot platforms, intelligence and stack, and kind describes the artifact form. Use cases are cross-cutting filters, for example <a href="/api/v1/entities.json?use_case=sim-to-real"><code>use_case=sim-to-real</code></a>.</p>
      <h2>Entity documents</h2><p><code>GET /project/:slug.json</code> · <code>GET /project/:slug.md</code></p><p>Canonical JSON and compact Markdown representations are generated from the same dossier as the human-readable project page. JSON includes attributed facts, use cases, relationships and reviewed resource manifests. Resource revisions and Git blob hashes identify inspected files; they are not a live file mirror.</p>
      <h2>Registry statistics</h2><p><code>GET /api/v1/stats.json</code></p>
      <h2>Response policy</h2><p>Responses include cache headers and canonical project URLs. Entity documents expose each current fact's source and observation date; bulk observation-history exports are not yet available. Repository metrics may refresh automatically while product specifications and resource manifests retain their own review dates.</p>
    </article></section>
  </div></div>
</BaseLayout>
